        "Organic reach collapsed (“Facebook Zero”): Earned shifted to Paid, and people retreated into walled gardens like WhatsApp and Messenger.",
        "Followers aren't the prize: 84% have liked a brand, 79% never got a reply, and only about 2 in 10 are true promoters, who spread bad experiences as readily as good ones."
