      source: [{ doc: "Ogilvy on Advertising in the Digital Age (Miles Young, 2017)", section: "Chapter 12 · The Three Battlegrounds · Where do the insights come from?; The Evolution of the Community Manager · PDF pp. 292–295, 297", who: "Miles Young" }],
